    "description": "This reference organ, Placenta-full-term-female (https://humanatlas.io/3d-reference-library) was created using a\nsculpted model of the placenta, partly informed by MRI data from the Department of Obstetrics, Gynecology, and\nReproductive Sciences, Division of Maternal-Fetal Medicine at UC San Diego Health. *Human Microscopic Anatomy* (Krstić\n1991) and Mannelli et al. 2015 were consulted.\n\n**Bibliography:**\n\n* Krstić, Radivoj V. 1991. *Human Microscopic Anatomy*. Berlin, Heidelberg: Springer. https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-662-02676-2.\n* Mannelli, Chiara, Francesca Ietta, Anna Maria Avanzati, Dariusz Skarzynski, and Luana Paulesu. 2015. “Biological Tools to Study the Effects of Environmental Contaminants at the Feto–Maternal Interface.” *Dose-Response* 13 (4): 1559325815611902. https://doi.org/10.1177/1559325815611902.",
